# ============================================================
# .dockerignore for Clinic Management System (ASP.NET Web Forms)
# Rule: cz-dotnet-1040 - Unoptimized Web Forms Container Image Size
# Excludes source code, PDB files, and temp artifacts from the
# Windows container image to reduce image size for EKS deployment.
# ============================================================

# ----- Source Code (compiled by build stage; not needed in runtime image) -----
**/*.cs
**/*.vb
**/*.csproj
**/*.vbproj
**/*.sln
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.cache

# ----- PDB / Debug Symbol Files -----
**/*.pdb
**/*.mdb

# ----- Build Output & Intermediate Directories -----
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/Debug/
**/Release/

# ----- NuGet Packages (restored during build stage) -----
**/packages/
**/*.nupkg
**/*.nuspec
**/nuget.config
**/.nuget/

# ----- Temporary & IDE Files -----
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.DS_Store
**/desktop.ini
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.log
**/*.bak
**/*.orig

# ----- Test Projects & Test Artifacts -----
**/*Test*/
**/*Tests*/
**/*.Test.*/
**/*.Tests.*/
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/

# ----- Documentation & Non-Runtime Assets -----
README.md
LICENSE
*.pdf
images/
Database\ Files/
*.sql

# ----- Git Metadata -----
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ----- CI/CD & Infrastructure Files (not needed in image) -----
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
*.sh
*.ps1
*.cmd
*.bat

# ----- Roslyn Compiler Binaries (already in SDK; not needed in runtime) -----
**/roslyn/

# ----- Application Insights Config (managed via env vars in container) -----
**/ApplicationInsights.config
